---
import Figure from "../Figure.astro";
// The first figure: one run drawn as a disk, with a short key beside it.
// #hero-demes and #hero-best are filled from the data by src/figures/disk.ts.
---
<Figure width="wide" class="teaser">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-main"><div class="fig relwrap brushable" id="hero"><div id="heroDisk"></div></div>
      <div class="racebar">
        <button class="playb" id="heroPlay" type="button">Pause</button>
        <input class="rng" type="range" id="heroT" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="0" aria-label="Attempt" />
        <span class="num" id="heroTv"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="chips-row" id="hero-chips" aria-label="Focus one deme"></div>
      <p class="hero-info" id="hero-info"></p></div>
    <div class="howto">
      <p class="label">How to read it</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 26 L4 6 A22 22 0 0 1 36 6 Z" fill="#D0702F" opacity=".18"/><circle cx="14" cy="11" r="3" fill="#D0702F"/><circle cx="24" cy="9" r="3" fill="#D0702F"/></svg>
          <p><b>Each colour is a deme</b>, one of <span id="hero-demes">8</span> groups of programs evolving on their own.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 28" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="5" cy="22" r="2.5" style="fill:var(--fig-ink)"/><path d="M5 22 L19 13 L33 6" fill="none" stroke="#3A6EA5" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="19" cy="13" r="3" fill="#3A6EA5"/><circle cx="33" cy="6" r="3" fill="#3A6EA5"/></svg>
          <p><b>Programs grow outward</b> from the starting program at the centre.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 28" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="14" r="2.5" fill="#6E5BB5"/><circle cx="24" cy="14" r="6" fill="#6E5BB5"/></svg>
          <p><b>Bigger dot, higher score.</b></p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 22 Q20 -2 37 22" fill="none" style="stroke:var(--fig-chord)" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
          <p><b>A red arc is a finding</b> one deme passed to another.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 40 28" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="20" cy="14" r="5" fill="#B08A20"/><circle cx="20" cy="14" r="10" fill="none" style="stroke:var(--fig-ink)" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg>
          <p><b>The ring is the best program</b>, score <span id="hero-best">0.9994</span>.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Fragment slot="caption">
    <b>Figure 1.</b> Every program in one SCiEL run on the third autocorrelation constant. It grows attempt by attempt;
    pick a deme to follow it, or tap a program to trace its ancestry.
  </Fragment>
</Figure>
